    <region left="0" top="5751" width="748" height="53" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Under the specified loads and assumed plumbing load distribution, the resultant floor reaction lies within the 1200 x 650 mm base footprint, with a minimum edge clearance of 191.1mm. The assembly is therefore predicted to remnain stable against tipping for this load case. External pushes and pulls were not included.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="5805" width="175" height="29" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="14" isBreakable="false">
